The '''Fossil Research Center''' is a [[Location]] within the {{Zone|Dwarven Base Camp}} of the {{Zone|Dwarven Mines}}, which requires {{Coll|Heart of the Mountain 7}} to access. It features [[Fossil Excavator]] and {{NPCSprite|Dr. Stone}}.

== Purpose ==
{{Main|Dr. Stone|Fossils|Excavating}}
In this area the player may interact with {{NPCSprite|Dr. Stone}} who serves as a guide to {{zone|Glacite Mineshafts}}, obtaining {{Item|Suspicious Scrap}} and [[Excavating]]. One of the rewards from excavating are [[Fossils]], which can be given to Dr. Stone in return for [[Heart of the Mountain|HOTM]] exp, {{Skill|Mining|XP}}, {{Glacite Powder}}, and even new [[The Forge|forge recipes]] for [[Pets]]. The [[Fossil Excavator]] is also located in this area.

In this area players can also view the Fossils they have donated to Dr. Stone, when interacted with, Dr. Stone will provide additional information about the Fossils and the story they tell.

